{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" initial=\"a\">\n  <state id=\"a\">\n    <onentry><send event=\"tick\" delay=\"5 seconds\"/></onentry>\n    <transition event=\"tick\" target=\"b\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"b\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/xsd-invalid-delay-pattern.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xsd-invalid-delay-pattern.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":49,"endLine":3,"startColumn":40,"startLine":3}}}],"message":{"markdown":"invalid value `5 seconds` for attribute `delay` on `<send>`\n\n**Note:** the W3C SCXML 1.0 schema rejects this under XML Schema constraint `cvc-pattern-valid`\n\n**Help:** `delay` expects a CSS2 duration such as `500ms`, `2s`, or `1.5m`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §6.2 <send>\n\n**Spec:** XML Schema 1.0 Part 2 §4.3.4.4 pattern valid (`cvc-pattern-valid`)","text":"invalid value `5 seconds` for attribute `delay` on `<send>`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":139,"start":130},"category":"schema"},"ruleId":"XSD-cvc-pattern-valid"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"SCXML datatypes such as durations (`delay`) and event names are defined by regular expressions in the W3C schema"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: use a value matching the documented lexical form.\n\nSpecification: XML Schema 1.0 Part 2 §4.3.4.4 Pattern valid\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain XSD-cvc-pattern-valid` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/xmlschema-2/#rf-pattern","id":"XSD-cvc-pattern-valid","name":"XSD-cvc-pattern-valid","properties":{"category":"schema"},"shortDescription":{"text":"a value does not match its datatype's pattern"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}